&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive multidisciplinary design optimization (MDO) frameworks to rapidly evaluate aircraft trade-offs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
