&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hold a bachelor’s degree or higher in Aerospace Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
